Cell["\<\
Below I check if both left and right multiplication of the supermatrix with \
its superinverse give identity. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9754381046830616`*^9, 
  3.9754381448905754`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"69e2006b-09c5-7f4e-8997-\
