Cell["\<\
The following function is to determine the maximum order needed in the \
Grassmann series expansion\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.977058083559778*^9, 
  3.977058122598629*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e1f83d8e-000a-3440-96dd-\
